-<section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">Go deeper</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Each area, in detail</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Every area above has its own page with the market data, the tax and insurance position, the flood picture and the rental rules.</p><div class="wta-cols"><a href="/submarkets/little-river/">Little River</a><a href="/submarkets/north-myrtle-beach/">North Myrtle Beach</a><a href="/submarkets/myrtle-beach/">Myrtle Beach</a><a href="/submarkets/carolina-forest/">Carolina Forest</a><a href="/submarkets/conway/">Conway</a><a href="/submarkets/surfside-beach/">Surfside Beach</a><a href="/submarkets/garden-city/">Garden City</a><a href="/submarkets/murrells-inlet/">Murrells Inlet</a><a href="/submarkets/pawleys-island/">Pawleys Island</a></div><style>.wta-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:0 2.5rem;max-width:760px}.wta-cols a{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brass-ink);text-decoration:none;padding:.55rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.wta-cols a:hover{color:var(--navy)}</style></div></section>
